# ── Trivy CVE Ignore List ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Format: CVE-ID  # Justification | Ticket | Expires
#
# POLICY:
# - Only CRITICAL/HIGH CVEs with NO available fix may be ignored
# - Each entry MUST have: justification, tracking ticket, expiry (max 90 days)
# - Entries are reviewed weekly and removed when fix becomes available
# - Any entry older than 90 days auto-fails the pipeline (remove to re-evaluate)
#
# HOW TO ADD:
# 1. Confirm no fix exists: trivy image --ignore-unfixed=false <image>
# 2. Open a tracking issue in GitHub
# 3. Add entry below with expiry date 90 days from today
# 4. Get approval from security team
#
# CURRENT EXCEPTIONS:
# (none — all CVEs resolved or have available fixes)
#
# EXAMPLE FORMAT (do not uncomment without real CVE):
# CVE-2023-XXXXX  # python:3.6-slim — no fix in base image | Issue #1 | Expires 2026-10-29
